{
  "functions": {
    "api/**/*.ts": {
      "runtime": "nodejs20.x"
    }
  },
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/api/(.*)",
      "destination": "/api/$1"
    }
  ],
  "routes": [
    {
      "src": "/api/(.*)",
      "dest": "/api/$1"
    },
    {
      "handle": "filesystem"
    },
    {
      "src": "/(.*)",
      "dest": "/index.html"
    }
  ]
}

### Option 2: Move API to a Different Path

Instead of `/api/gallery`, use a path that won't conflict:

**Rename your function file:**
```
api/gallery.ts  →  api/unsplash-gallery.ts